---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Services | Mission Vision Strategy"
  description="Organizational assessment, strategic planning, operations and workflow design, and stakeholder research for mission-driven organizations."
  current="services"
  contactHeading="Not sure where to start?"
  contactText="Most conversations begin with a simple question: what's getting in the way? We'll help you figure out the right first step."
>
    <section class="hero page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow"><img class="star" src="/images/star.svg" alt="">Services</p>
        <h1>What we do.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Four ways we help mission-driven organizations get clear and get moving.
          Most engagements combine two or more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skyline"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <article class="service" id="assessment">
          <div>
            <h2>Organizational assessment</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>A clear, evidence-based picture of how your organization is working today:
              what's strong, what's strained, and what to do about it.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Governance, structure, and decision-making review</li>
              <li>Volunteer, staff, and workforce capacity</li>
              <li>Financial and operational performance</li>
              <li>Culture and climate assessments, including accreditation self-studies</li>
              <li>A written report with prioritized recommendations for leadership</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service" id="planning">
          <div>
            <h2>Strategic planning</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>A direction your board and team believe in, and a roadmap specific enough to
              run.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Facilitated planning with boards, leadership, and staff</li>
              <li>Mission and vision refinement</li>
              <li>Goals, priorities, and measures of success</li>
              <li>Growth strategy for membership, programs, and events</li>
              <li>Implementation roadmap with owners and timelines</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service" id="operations">
          <div>
            <h2>Operations &amp; workflow design</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>Processes and structures that make good work easier to do, and easier to
              repeat.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Workflow analysis and operational redesign</li>
              <li>Role clarity and team structure</li>
              <li>Standardized rubrics and decision frameworks</li>
              <li>AI-assisted workflows, designed around people rather than replacing them</li>
              <li>Content and production frameworks for media teams</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service" id="research">
          <div>
            <h2>Stakeholder research</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>Listening done well: turning what students, members, staff, and audiences
              tell you into better programs and decisions.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Stakeholder interviews and listening sessions</li>
              <li>Surveys and qualitative analysis</li>
              <li>User-centered program design</li>
              <li>Repeatable engagement frameworks your team can keep running</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

</Base>
